==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Arbok|29}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*'''Venomous Fang''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Furious Fists|Drapion|65}} from the {{TCG|Furious Fists}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

